            "detailed_description": "You play as Azai Kyousuke, the son of an infamous gangster. Kyousuke knows what he likes and lets nothing stand in his way in getting what he wants. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nReferred to as God by his classmates, he often enjoys listening to Bach and &quot;working&quot; part time for his stepfather. But when a beautiful girl named Usami Haru appears in town along with an international criminal known as &quot;Maou,&quot; they bring with them their cat-and-mouse game of plotting and intrigue.",
